WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:14.840
There is no corner of this world you have not explored. No geography of the soul which you cannot navigate.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.720
Mr. Shakespeare,

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.670
I don't want to pester you, good

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:25.419
Excellent news cheerio. I just wanted to ask you, the best way to get started as a writer is to start writing

00:00:25.419 --> 00:00:27.400
No, really could I just. I don't have a favourite play

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.160
I admire all my fellow dramatists equally and yes

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:34.980
I do think women should be allowed to perform the female roles as is the practice on the continent now, please if you'll excuse me

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:44.770
Father, why are you come home? No more stories left to write? I've lived so long in imaginary worlds

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.420
I think I've lost sight of what is real.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.800
Will, it's Sunday.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.540
You miss Church here, they'll fine you

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:59.709
Your talent has a greater scope than all the other poets, and yet you've lived the smallest life.

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:07.959
Family is everything, it's love not ambition that will blossom in this garden. Well, something has to. I'm not a good gardener. It's true.

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:11.320
My husband thinks you've come home to die

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:14.949
I've just bought a pension. I can't die for at least 10 years or I'll be ruined.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:22.480
You went to London and became this great writer with a wife at home. You were hardly here. To us you're a guest

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.750
Good night husband

00:01:25.579 --> 00:01:28.389
Retirement hasn't exactly brought the peace we might have hoped for

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.700
You must write again Will, people need you.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:36.300
My soul is empty.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:41.080
Your soul is not empty father, your soul has the whole world in it.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:48.420
Why, why did you stop writing?  I've never let the truth get in the way of a good story

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:52.940
All these years worried about your reputation

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.100
Have you even once considered mine?

00:01:55.100 --> 00:02:00.660
Through my genius I've brought fame and fortune to this house! I'm the head of this family!

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.360
And if you're honest with yourself, then whatever you write...

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:14.540
All is true

